The three immediate-after constraints form the blocks Ben-Finn, Hana-Ivo, and Elif-Ann. Gus before Ivo plus exactly one slot between Gus and Hana forces the pattern Gus, (someone), Hana, Ivo. Hana before Dev before Finn, Ivo before Ann, and the separation constraints then force Elif-Ann to the end and leave a single placement for Dev, Ben-Finn, and Cara.

SCHEDULE: {"1":"Gus","2":"Cara","3":"Hana","4":"Ivo","5":"Dev","6":"Ben","7":"Finn","8":"Elif","9":"Ann"}
